# Plan part F6's "done when" (ADR-0415 item 2, ADR-0438): `top` in a room around a
# program that spawns its own image three times. `t_shared keep` starts a
# launcher L, which reads a file once (its transfer buffer), and waits at three
# phases for the file this script writes after `top tab`; before each phase it
# waits for L's job to stop changing (a closed file's object is charged until
# the reaper has it): L alone; then three children of its own image; then one
# child of the file. The whole is run twice in one room.
# tools/check-top-image.py reads the room's memory at each phase from the log
# and checks that the three spawns of the image cost the room their own pages and
# no text, that the spawn of the file cost one more than that by the image's
# pages (which the program prints), and that after each run the room holds what
# it held before: the second run ends where the first did, so a kept image or
# buffer fails (make test-libposix runs this with the checker).
! panicked
! ZORAYA-PANIC
< \r\n~> 
> room new tab --mem 64M --procs 64 +w /work\r
< tab --colour
< \r\n~> 
> room tab\r
< tab /work> 
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> /bin/t_shared keep &\r
< t_shared: keep: L alone
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> echo go > /work/t_shared.go\r
< t_shared: keep: three children of its own image
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> echo go > /work/t_shared.go\r
< t_shared: keep: and one child of the file
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> echo go > /work/t_shared.go\r
< t_shared: passed
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> /bin/t_shared keep &\r
< t_shared: keep: L alone
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> echo go > /work/t_shared.go\r
< t_shared: keep: three children of its own image
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> echo go > /work/t_shared.go\r
< t_shared: keep: and one child of the file
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> echo go > /work/t_shared.go\r
< t_shared: passed
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> top tab\r
< limits --mem 64M
< tab /work> 
> room --leave\r
> room remove tab --kill\r
> poweroff\r
